@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam rectangleBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam rectangleBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam noteBorderColor #B99557
skinparam nodesep 38
skinparam ranksep 42
title SQ — recovery evidence and current authority
top to bottom direction
rectangle "Defined loss scenario / coverage / criteria\nActual protected source + isolated target + operator authority" as Preconditions
rectangle "Actual restored candidate\nRequired records / artifacts / references" as Candidate
rectangle "Actual scoped checks\nIntegrity / current access / external disposition / core usability" as Checks
rectangle "Measured scoped result\nLoss/time vs agreed targets; gaps and limits explicit" as Result #DFF1EA
Preconditions --> Candidate : only separately authorized actual drill
Candidate --> Checks : restored bytes alone are insufficient
Checks --> Result : only evidence-supported usable-state conclusion
note bottom of Preconditions
Backups are not configured.
No live overwrite or performed restore is implied.
end note
note bottom of Result
Old grants / pending sends / jobs / deploys do not automatically resume.
Local restored state does not rewrite provider or target truth.
end note

legend bottom
Logical analysis / evidence boundaries, not installed controls or selected architecture.
No security, load, provider, backup, restore or live-change operation performed.
endlegend
@enduml
